WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Career Agent
A private workspace for your next chapter.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Your search, in one calm workspace
See active opportunities, conversations, and upcoming deadlines at a glance.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Start with the experience you already have
Import a .tex or .txt resume, or keep named versions of your working profile.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Connect your experience to an opportunity
Bring a job description and your original profile. Everything stays in this browser.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Understand the fit, and the gaps
Compare detected skills and keywords. The score measures text overlap, not hiring odds.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
A first draft. Then your own words.
Edit a resume draft and cover letter built from your existing experience.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Review the exact application package
Approval belongs to these materials, this profile, and this opportunity.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:39.000
A change means another review
Editing the resume automatically resets approval. Your next step stays deliberate.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Keep the package with the opportunity
Save the reviewed materials to the tracker. Repeated saves update the same role.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Find the detail you need
Search applications by company, role, contact, or notes; filter and sort the list.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Turn a conversation into a next step
Update status, deadlines, contacts, and notes. The saved package stays close at hand.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Your preferences. Your data.
Set your search direction and export a private backup. Nothing is submitted automatically.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:01.000
A little direction. A next step.
Career Agent · React + TypeScript · Local-first · Reviewed by you
